<title>USA: Track Data to buy back up to 250,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Track Data to buy back up to 250,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Track Data Corp said Wednesday its board of directors had authorized the purchase of up to 250,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Track Data, which has more than 14 million shares in circulation, provides real-time financial market data, fundamental research, charting and analytical services to institutional and individual investors.</p>
</text>
